**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.github
.claude
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
**/coverage
*.md
!server/ARCHITECTURE.md

# Secrets: every real environment file at any depth (.env, .env.local, .env.production,
# .env.docker ...). Only the committed *.example templates may enter the build context.
# (This list used to name just .env and .env.local, so a stray .env.production or
# .env.docker would have been copied into the image by `COPY client client` /
# `COPY server/prisma ...` and stayed in a layer.)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example

# Keys, certificates and Google credentials.
**/*.pem
**/*.crt
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/client_secret*.json
**/service-account*.json

# Database dumps and backups - data, never part of an image.
**/*.sql.gz
**/*.dump
**/db_backup_*
**/docker_db_backup_*
**/premigrate_*
**/backups
**/snapshots

# Editor, OS and local-tool leftovers.
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.vite
# Design masters (source art the shipped images were made from) - not part of any image.
client/design
**/.eslintcache
**/Thumbs.db
**/.DS_Store
